Marley Mildred: It's Bob! I've been suspicious of him for a long time. I don't trust anyone who keeps that quiet. But I've seen him gathering up crewmates and organizing meetings. I even heard him muttering about it in his sleep. Always saying "I'm gonna kill the captain, can't stand him". It's hilarious how obvious it is. Do the right thing Captain and throw him off the ship! [ID:marley 1.3]
